@page "/lungCancer"
@using MudBlazor
@using OmarDesignSystem

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.Large" Class="mb-16 mt-8">
    
    <MudStack AlignItems="AlignItems.Center" Class="mb-12">
        <MainHeading>Analiza Raka Pluća</MainHeading>
        <BodyText Style="max-width: 700px;">
            Ova platforma služi za treniranje, analizu i direktnu usporedbu modela mašinskog učenja razvijenih u C# i Python programskim jezicima koristeći IQOTHNCCD CT dijagnostiku.
        </BodyText>
    </MudStack>

    <MudGrid Spacing="4" Class="mb-8">
        <MudItem xs="12" md="6">
            <MudCard Elevation="2">
                <MudCardHeader>
                    <CardHeaderAvatar>
                        <MudAvatar Color="Color.Secondary" Variant="Variant.Filled" Size="Size.Large">
                            <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ModelTraining" />
                        </MudAvatar>
                    </CardHeaderAvatar>
                    <CardHeaderContent>
                        <SectionHeading>Treniraj Model</SectionHeading>
                    </CardHeaderContent>
                </MudCardHeader>
                <MudCardContent>
                    <BodyText>
                        Konfigurišite i pokrenite proces treniranja novog modela. Podesite broj epoha, augmentaciju slika (rotaciju) i odaberite željeni backend sistem (C# ili Python).
                    </BodyText>
                </MudCardContent>
                <MudCardActions>
                    <MudButton Href="/lungCancer/trainer" Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" Class="mb-2">
                        Započni Treniranje
                    </MudButton>
                </MudCardActions>
            </MudCard>
        </MudItem>

        <MudItem xs="12" md="6">
            <MudCard Elevation="2">
                <MudCardHeader>
                    <CardHeaderAvatar>
                        <MudAvatar Color="Color.Secondary" Variant="Variant.Filled" Size="Size.Large">
                            <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.PlayArrow" />
                        </MudAvatar>
                    </CardHeaderAvatar>
                    <CardHeaderContent>
                        <SectionHeading>Pokreni Analizu</SectionHeading>
                    </CardHeaderContent>
                </MudCardHeader>
                <MudCardContent>
                    <BodyText>
                        Izvršite evaluaciju istreniranih modela na nezavisnim CT snimcima pluća. Model će klasifikovati tkivo kao normalno, benigno ili maligno.
                    </BodyText>
                </MudCardContent>
                <MudCardActions>
                    <MudButton Href="/lungCancer/inference" Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Primary" Class="mb-2">
                        Nova Analiza
                    </MudButton>
                </MudCardActions>
            </MudCard>
        </MudItem>
    </MudGrid>

    <MudGrid Spacing="4">
        <MudItem xs="12" md="6">
            <MudCard Elevation="1">
                <MudCardHeader>
                    <CardHeaderAvatar>
                        <MudAvatar Color="Color.Secondary">
                            <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.List" />
                        </MudAvatar>
                    </CardHeaderAvatar>
                    <CardHeaderContent>
                        <SectionHeading>Pregled Modela</SectionHeading>
                    </CardHeaderContent>
                </MudCardHeader>
                <MudCardContent>
                    <BodyText>
                        Pregledajte historiju svih do sada treniranih modela, analizirajte njihove finalne parametre ili obrišite one koji više nisu potrebni.
                    </BodyText>
                </MudCardContent>
                <MudCardActions>
                    <MudButton Href="/lungCancer/models" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Primary" Class="mb-2">
                        Otvori Pregled
                    </MudButton>
                </MudCardActions>
            </MudCard>
        </MudItem>

        <MudItem xs="12" md="6">
            <MudCard Elevation="1">
                <MudCardHeader>
                    <CardHeaderAvatar>
                        <MudAvatar Color="Color.Secondary">
                            <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.StackedLineChart" />
                        </MudAvatar>
                    </CardHeaderAvatar>
                    <CardHeaderContent>
                        <SectionHeading>Uporedi Modele</SectionHeading>
                    </CardHeaderContent>
                </MudCardHeader>
                <MudCardContent>
                    <BodyText>
                        Direktno usporedite performanse različitih modela kroz epohe (Loss, Accuracy). Odaberite proizvoljan broj modela za generisanje grafikona.
                    </BodyText>
                </MudCardContent>
                <MudCardActions>
                    <MudButton Href="/lungCancer/comparison" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Primary" Class="mb-2">
                        Uporedi Performanse
                    </MudButton>
                </MudCardActions>
            </MudCard>
        </MudItem>
    </MudGrid>

</MudContainer>